    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093060/extras/bc20daf926668eb04ff0b76fb24cfbb4.avif?t=1754399071\" /></div> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093060/extras/dc3085eaea2434fd3a6e8f5c37a8fcb8.webp?t=1754399071\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Soulbound, experience a thrilling 2D multiplayer platformer where precision meets unpredictability. Engage in fast-paced, asymmetrical PvP battles that keep you on your toes in an ever-changing game of cat and mouse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whether you're a fan of competitive platformers or looking for a unique multiplayer experience, Soulbound offers intense matches filled with unexpected twists. Its blend of speed, strategy, and ever-changing levels ensures no two games are the same.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093060/extras/e14a9ee0005bc7e17dcba8f0f3f8df53.avif?t=1754399071\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093060/extras/fc60303177d55728f7c672ba32a13b46.poster.avif?t=1754399071\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093060/extras/fc60303177d55728f7c672ba32a13b46.webm?t=1754399071\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As the ghost, you tactically possess various enemies, each with unique abilities, to set traps and ambushes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093060/extras/c895b4266eb3745c7b23ab039cf59723.webp?t=1754399071\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093060/extras/621fc38ec6387dfb850276418621f572.poster.avif?t=1754399071\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093060/extras/621fc38ec6387dfb850276418621f572.webm?t=1754399071\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div>Upon the ninja's demise, roles switch, ensuring both players experience the thrill of the chase and the hunt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093060/extras/64eba7549273bbd2cc12772fc4399afb.webp?t=1754399071\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093060/extras/1da98934ca2bbffc3841d957d5444f5f.poster.webp?t=1754399071\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093060/extras/1da98934ca2bbffc3841d957d5444f5f.webp?t=1754399071\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div>Each run offers a new challenge with randomly generated stages, enhancing replayability. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093060/extras/4b37f1da9c808bb40770243212adb7b6.webp?t=1754399071\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093060/extras/d5a91d1fb3ca2955122a1566be6fff71.poster.webp?t=1754399071\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093060/extras/d5a91d1fb3ca2955122a1566be6fff71.webp?t=1754399071\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div>Master wall-jumps, dashes, and evasive manoeuvres to outpace your opponent. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093060/extras/5f507c68e221efdcac40764e0e7b2927.webp?t=1754399071\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093060/extras/5b86ecdb288357b6ae0c12de7f022460.poster.avif?t=1754399071\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093060/extras/5b86ecdb288357b6ae0c12de7f022460.webm?t=1754399071\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div>One player controls the agile ninja, navigating treacherous terrain, while the other becomes a ghost, possessing enemies to thwart the ninja's progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093060/extras/35f53e186a026e0a76a118302f83e2a3.webp?t=1754399071\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093060/extras/03e50fa764778afbb52396176de3ed5b.poster.avif?t=1754399071\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093060/extras/03e50fa764778afbb52396176de3ed5b.webm?t=1754399071\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093060/extras/bc20daf926668eb04ff0b76fb24cfbb4.avif?t=1754399071\" /></div> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093060/extras/dc3085eaea2434fd3a6e8f5c37a8fcb8.webp?t=1754399071\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Soulbound, experience a thrilling 2D multiplayer platformer where precision meets unpredictability. Engage in fast-paced, asymmetrical PvP battles that keep you on your toes in an ever-changing game of cat and mouse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whether you're a fan of competitive platformers or looking for a unique multiplayer experience, Soulbound offers intense matches filled with unexpected twists. Its blend of speed, strategy, and ever-changing levels ensures no two games are the same.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093060/extras/e14a9ee0005bc7e17dcba8f0f3f8df53.avif?t=1754399071\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093060/extras/fc60303177d55728f7c672ba32a13b46.poster.avif?t=1754399071\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093060/extras/fc60303177d55728f7c672ba32a13b46.webm?t=1754399071\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As the ghost, you tactically possess various enemies, each with unique abilities, to set traps and ambushes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093060/extras/c895b4266eb3745c7b23ab039cf59723.webp?t=1754399071\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093060/extras/621fc38ec6387dfb850276418621f572.poster.avif?t=1754399071\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093060/extras/621fc38ec6387dfb850276418621f572.webm?t=1754399071\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div>Upon the ninja's demise, roles switch, ensuring both players experience the thrill of the chase and the hunt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093060/extras/64eba7549273bbd2cc12772fc4399afb.webp?t=1754399071\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093060/extras/1da98934ca2bbffc3841d957d5444f5f.poster.webp?t=1754399071\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093060/extras/1da98934ca2bbffc3841d957d5444f5f.webp?t=1754399071\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div>Each run offers a new challenge with randomly generated stages, enhancing replayability. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093060/extras/4b37f1da9c808bb40770243212adb7b6.webp?t=1754399071\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093060/extras/d5a91d1fb3ca2955122a1566be6fff71.poster.webp?t=1754399071\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093060/extras/d5a91d1fb3ca2955122a1566be6fff71.webp?t=1754399071\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div>Master wall-jumps, dashes, and evasive manoeuvres to outpace your opponent. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093060/extras/5f507c68e221efdcac40764e0e7b2927.webp?t=1754399071\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093060/extras/5b86ecdb288357b6ae0c12de7f022460.poster.avif?t=1754399071\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093060/extras/5b86ecdb288357b6ae0c12de7f022460.webm?t=1754399071\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div>One player controls the agile ninja, navigating treacherous terrain, while the other becomes a ghost, possessing enemies to thwart the ninja's progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093060/extras/35f53e186a026e0a76a118302f83e2a3.webp?t=1754399071\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093060/extras/03e50fa764778afbb52396176de3ed5b.poster.avif?t=1754399071\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093060/extras/03e50fa764778afbb52396176de3ed5b.webm?t=1754399071\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p>",
